      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 2,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Those photos were often captured by spacecraft \u2013 robotic explorers doing their work far away from Earth.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c \u1EA3nh \u0111\u00F3 th\u01B0\u1EDDng do c\u00E1c t\u00E0u v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 ch\u1EE5p \u2013 nh\u1EEFng nh\u00E0 th\u00E1m hi\u1EC3m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u00E1y l\u00E0m vi\u1EC7c \u1EDF r\u1EA5t xa Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t.",
        "StartTime": 8.6,
