    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.how-do-we-launch-things-into-space.8f1329e6aeff4d11bab8b131dff8ecc9",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 3,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "But how exactly do we send these spacecraft so far away? Well, it all starts with a rocket. A really, really big one.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Nh\u01B0ng ch\u00FAng ta g\u1EEDi nh\u1EEFng t\u00E0u v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 n\u00E0y \u0111i xa nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy b\u1EB1ng c\u00E1ch n\u00E0o? \u00C0, m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t t\u00EAn l\u1EEDa. M\u1ED9t t\u00EAn l\u1EEDa r\u1EA5t, r\u1EA5t l\u1EDBn.",
        "StartTime": 15.9,
        "EndTime": 25.6
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.how-do-we-launch-things-into-space"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.how-do-we-launch-things-into-space.b88bd24c6f2a4204bf0f3dcc73c96f7f",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 1,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "How Do We Launch Things into Space? You\u2019ve probably seen beautiful photos of Earth and other planets in our solar system.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Ch\u00FAng ta ph\u00F3ng c\u00E1c v\u1EADt th\u1EC3 v\u00E0o kh\u00F4ng gian nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\u00E0o? C\u00F3 l\u1EBD b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 th\u1EA5y nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c \u1EA3nh \u0111\u1EB9p v\u1EC1 Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t v\u00E0 c\u00E1c h\u00E0nh tinh kh\u00E1c trong h\u1EC7 M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a ch\u00FAng ta.",
        "StartTime": 0,
        "EndTime": 8.6
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.how-do-we-launch-things-into-space"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.how-do-we-launch-things-into-space.bf5f5250b2f4468dac6700f84ea921dc",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 12,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "This happens because there is a balance between the energy the satellite picked up from the rocket \u2013 called momentum \u2013",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0110i\u1EC1u n\u00E0y x\u1EA3y ra v\u00EC c\u00F3 s\u1EF1 c\u00E2n b\u1EB1ng gi\u1EEFa n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\u00E0 v\u1EC7 tinh nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EEB t\u00EAn l\u1EEDa \u2013 g\u1ECDi l\u00E0 \u0111\u1ED9ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u2013",
        "StartTime": 81.5,
        "EndTime": 87.3
