      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 8,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "That\u2019s how fast you have to get going to fly above most of Earth\u2019s atmosphere and stay in orbit.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0110\u00F3 l\u00E0 t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 b\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EC3 bay l\u00EAn tr\u00EAn ph\u1EA7n l\u1EDBn kh\u00ED quy\u1EC3n c\u1EE7a Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t v\u00E0 \u1EDF l\u1EA1i tr\u00EAn qu\u1EF9 \u0111\u1EA1o.",
