      "key": "team.listening.b2.how-do-we-launch-things-into-space.f9b1783740dd448187c987a82aed49ba",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 10,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "A spacecraft that orbits Earth is sometimes called a satellite. A satellite is released from a rocket at a specific distance from Earth.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "M\u1ED9t t\u00E0u v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 quay quanh Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t \u0111\u00F4i khi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi l\u00E0 v\u1EC7 tinh. V\u1EC7 tinh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EA3 ra t\u1EEB t\u00EAn l\u1EEDa \u1EDF m\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3ng c\u00E1ch c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 so v\u1EDBi Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t.",
